<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:yehi_ratzon_milefanekha/5"/>שֶּׁתְּ֒הֵא אֲמִֽירָה זוּ
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:yehi_ratzon_milefanekha/6"/>מְרֻצָּה לְפָנֶֽיךָ
